    "text": "By Sruly ,\n1 days ago Spring Valley Police responded to a domestic violence investigation on December 9, 2025, at approximately 4:30 p.m., after learning that earlier that day, at around 11:30 a.m., a female victim was violently attacked inside her residence by her ex-boyfriend. Authorities determined that the incident involved a severe physical assault and unlawful conduct. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
